* text=auto eol=lf

*.sln text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.nupkg binary
*.snupkg binary

